MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_001: Got a big match coming up that's separate from the\ngames. You wanna take part?
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_002: I'm managing the White-Maned Demon, and his\nforces could use some bulking up.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_003: <NCA>Ask about the match.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_004: <NCB>Ask about the White-Maned Demon.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_005: <ACA>Well, it's small in terms of scale—big in terms of\nimpact on the empire.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_006: <ACA>What they call a "friendly match" against the king\nof Brigid.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_007: <ACB>You've never heard of Bertrand, the gladiator trying\nto finish the Trial of the Chariot?
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_008: <ACB>He's supposed to prove his innocence by filling\nthe Bringer of War's chariot with gold.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_009: <ACB>As for the match, it'll be against the king of Brigid.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m01_010: Just have to make extra-dextra sure we win, since\nhis island is pretty important to Dagda.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m03_001: I'm not out here handing out invites to everyone\nI meet, OK? I know about your skills.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m03_002: So does Poloni, who's putting on the match. He'd be\nthrilled to let you in there.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m03_003: I'm not one to pressure! Just let me know.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m04_001: What do you say? Up for a little scrap with the\nking of Brigid?
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m04_002: Bertrand—the White-Maned Demon—he's ready\nto go. We can kick it off when you say so.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m04_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m04_008: Not gonna do it, huh? Guess that's fine... Let me\nknow if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m05_001: Sounds like the main matches for the Heroic Games\nare kicking off! Wonder who's gonna win.
MID_LGV_SCXX_04_m05_002: I'm sensing an uptick in tension since the qualifying\nrounds...and a lot less festiveness.
MID_LGA_SCXX_04_m05: <BLN>Who's gonna win?